(text "DAT board: sits in the 6809/6309 socket; the CPU plugs into J1 on top. All CPU pins pass straight through." (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c1e6f8f1-1838-429c-8b93-693a8333c700))
(text "U1 shadows writes to $FFA0-$FFAF (D7:D6), $FF90 (MMU enable, MC3), $FF91 (task), $FF9B (video bank), $FFD8/9 (speed)" (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d885ba70-0ee1-4a84-8b76-956ba97906b2))
(text "and drives BANK1:0 = physical A20:A19 for each GIME slot. Logic: cpld/dat2m.v, pins: cpld/dat2m_top.v." (at 25.40 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c66f8660-aa53-4b39-b100-1db08c45922f))
(text "CPLD IO pin numbers above carry the signals named on their labels (assignment chosen for routing)." (at 25.40 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 883090b1-ee7a-4b26-b955-f237185b01c1))
(text "neo-mem-2048k-compact - CC BY-SA 4.0." (at 25.40 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0f2925b1-6cd9-4a12-97c9-c33ceea8aa59))
